  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "BIM建築資訊模型實作",
    "sub_ename": "PRACTICE OF BUILDING INFORMATION MODELING",
    "describe_ch": "本系列課程有基礎班和進階班。在基礎階段，介紹建築BIM元件的管理、BIM參數和元件的整合、初階的BIM軟體程式設計與開發。在進階階段，將涵蓋BIM自動化軟體程式設計與開發、CAD軟體的整合和客製化、BIM和施工現場及工廠機器的整合、如何在設計、繪圖、施工、物業管理各階段使用在課堂上開發的BIM軟體來輔助偵錯和自動修正、如何以自己開發的BIM軟體在2D和3D空間操控元件、應用個人電腦、伺服器、和雲端。訓練有建築相關背景的學生學習電腦輔助設計、施工、和物業管理，熟悉如何開發建築相關的BIM軟體，利用電腦智能來提高建築業工作流程的正確性和效率。",
    "describe_eh": "These basic and advanced classes will start with an introduction to architectural BIM element management, BIM properties integration, and basic BIM computer programming. They will then cover BIM automation software development, CAD system integration and customization, industry machine integration, in class developed software for computer-aided checking/correction during design, drafting, construction, and facility management phases, programmatically manipulate BIM elements in 2D and 3D, and utilize computing environments on personal computers, corporate servers, and clouds. Students with an architecture background will learn computer-aided design, construction, and facilities management. They will master using computing intelligence to enhance industry processes and create BIM software for architecture-related fields.",
